{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_title", "source_sha256": "3bd11f4d137191eb3ef6a9300923f686a9b1167298c333be802be244262abb02", "ja": "どうか、届きますように", "zh": "但愿能够传达", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_synopsis", "source_sha256": "24af759d9bff5c908bc986a7def2df9da165530cb476abb5265a4ac5620c748d", "ja": "プロデューサーが担当を外れると勘違いした\n紬は、新曲公演で成長した姿を見せようと周\nりが心配するほどレッスンに打ちこむ。無事\nに誤解が解けた後、紬はあらためてファンの\nために、と凛として公演に臨む。", "zh": "䌷误以为制作人将不再培育自己，为了\n展现出自己成长后的模样而一味埋头苦练，\n让身边的人都十分担心。顺利解开误会后，\n䌷重新下定决心要为粉丝们努力，\n凛然地踏上了公演舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9f79c3736004fbfd2d4ef60266f523b402ac3cc587193167df5a3a7d9bd9f0eb", "ja": "（紬が歌い終えると、拍手の波が広がっていった。\n静かで深い感動が、会場をいつまでも包み込んで……）", "zh": "（䌷演唱完后，掌声在会场中此起彼落地响起。\n平静又深刻的感动弥漫在场中久久不散……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3821551cfbd299f0d7a9f0eaf0d1755e7d4310b4e93b662ed44efa0e0a0b2f1e", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様です。\nあの……最後まで、見届けてくれましたか？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n那个……你有好好看到最后吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1002_p", "source_sha256": "92235dc83c767938403387086dde876bc6356bdaf5bf10c9a39902c16a31da2c", "ja": "もちろん。今の最高の紬、確かに見せてもらったよ。\n新曲を作ってもらったかいがあったな！", "zh": "当然，䌷刚才的精彩表现，我全都看在眼里。\n也不枉费我为你准备这首新歌了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e7efd3cf3dd418c5ee30c90ffe121a2a7244be0faba7cce8cd18796c7c525173", "ja": "そ、そうですか。では、私は本当に……", "zh": "这、这样啊。那么，我真的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "025311b397618a42991e74ddbe407462763e9445211bcf3b8c2f436b483af611", "ja": "はっ。あの、勘違いではなく？", "zh": "啊，那个，这应该不是我的误会吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1005_p", "source_sha256": "38cc4b7646c71de1ddc8c3b259c3a80237cd0567021989da4172bb6231bc5917", "ja": "違う違う。っていうか、ファンの反応が全てだし。\nそれに……ほら。", "zh": "不是不是，是说粉丝的反应是不会骗人的啦。\n而且……你看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "5bc7a65afa04aa32b0e76d8210f98e93e2db828e6cf177a295fd6f1f9ee49b05", "ja": "紬！　真、見事な公演でした。同じ舞台に立つ\nアイドルとして、私も心が奮い立ちました。", "zh": "䌷！方才的公演着实相当出色。\n能够以偶像身分和你同台表演，小女子也倍感振奋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "ee356d901722fa9e3f39b0939fe15a556c78cea456bbfbebb81c96151bbc2dba", "ja": "本当に素敵だったわよ、紬ちゃん！　つい歌に聞き\n入ってしまって、ダンスを忘れそうになったくらい♪", "zh": "真的非常棒呢，小䌷！\n我因为听得太入迷，还差点忘记舞步了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "4fbfc1bac9b7744455e39676316f605d4a77b1a59e458e75962f604e4c05eace", "ja": "ぐすっ。私も、紬ちゃんの後ろで歌を聞いていたら、\n胸が熱くなって……涙が出てきちゃった！", "zh": "呜呜，我也一样，在小䌷身后听着小䌷的歌声，\n胸口就开始发热……眼泪都忍不住流出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "5e67064ef09d3ad003ce50bbd4313b6164e1e8139e14ece5531308b030ed07ae", "ja": "ああ、ハートに響く、いい歌だった。\nやるじゃないか、ムギ！", "zh": "是啊，真是一首扣人心弦的好歌。\n你很厉害嘛，䌷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e6c16f9af89f9a6113d4455edcff4970bc8c910260d7fe7993453b4937950da6", "ja": "みなさん……はい。ありがとうございます。\nまだまだ、いろいろと反省点もありましたが……。", "zh": "各位……嗯，谢谢你们的夸奖。\n尽管还有许多需要反省的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1011_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ac1eb66090f1f0b19b1c3a7decfb9d062beb6c196e57bd659cc7016b814532fc", "ja": "それでも、思いが届けられていたのでしたら……。\n少しは自信になります。", "zh": "但只要我的心意有传达出去……\n我就能稍微抱持一点自信了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1012_p", "source_sha256": "fc5926d03b909af45a787a6b0b030bf56de9e0bfaed8817f81131b6335d0c5f4", "ja": "大いに自信持っていいんじゃないかな。\nステージから気持ちを伝えてこそのアイドルだ。", "zh": "我觉得你可以抱持更多自信喔。\n偶像就是要能透过表演来传达心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1013_p", "source_sha256": "18ba8e1e3d0eb0751ef5ad388fd927f7374d7da831d54f1c579eb3ecbc9bcb8c", "ja": "今日の紬は、まぎれもなく、\nアイドルだったってことだよ！", "zh": "今天的䌷，毫无疑问地是一名偶像喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "6d490e5f73efa4ba41205a1f5d9c5376a6e4e5302ede702709a96f5012985a2d", "ja": "今日の私……。", "zh": "今天的我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1015_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3aca078dcf08252ad93d04de13efc3f6680222e9e612abb4deedd9b7dbd3df63", "ja": "あ、あなたはまさか、昨日までの私を\nアイドルと認めないつもりなのですか？", "zh": "难、难道昨天之前的我\n在你眼中都不算偶像吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1016_p", "source_sha256": "277068025c523f4d0c3b44c723f81966d381416c0a730b41ddee3aa2f68fb861", "ja": "いや、そうではなく……", "zh": "不，我不是那个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1017_027say", "source_sha256": "3ac41391aa1d13b28d85f65b45b1109262c410737a8add69c041fd63641e681e", "ja": "ねえ、ジュリア。前から思ってたけど、紬ちゃんって\n{$P$}には結構厳しいよね？", "zh": "欸，茱莉亚，我从之前就一直有个疑问……\n你不觉得小䌷对{$P$}特别苛刻吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1018_050jul", "source_sha256": "2daf1f8b9cbb6e16e548b9ebfee8996c78ce401a84c10d5ddada50b43aaa1a27", "ja": "まあ、あのバカPは、\nたまにヘンな仕事もってくるからな……。", "zh": "毕竟那个笨蛋P偶尔会\n接些奇怪的工作给我们嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1019_052kao", "source_sha256": "5d5e853b4cf22017e228bb2126e7cce348d94b27c15356503b99c8e1ac8c1839", "ja": "ふふっ、紬ちゃんのは、信頼の形なのかも。\n……あら？", "zh": "呵呵，那或许是小䌷表达信赖的方式呢。\n……哎呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1020_audience", "source_sha256": "e782e5818eba5abedd44e01e1ace725eef3945dc4d4aec6052c5a870f092251b", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！！", "zh": "安可！安可！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1021_008tak", "source_sha256": "0133f69685ace2fb45c42638002591f40aa53604749ca94f22c465d19a079af1", "ja": "あんこーるの声援ですね。\nふふっ、劇場が揺れるような、大きな声です。", "zh": "是要求安可的呼声呢。\n呵呵，声音大到剧场都在晃动了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1022_p", "source_sha256": "aeddaabcbf462cc0da4e70ed4ba2c1565306488cd29ea0932e425f25dfce25f5", "ja": "よし。みんな、スタンバイよろしく！", "zh": "好，麻烦大家准备上场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "3bd143e3945a1f815873d94a793429d0c1e2149cc5f533b0c3fbe3136dff8bc8", "ja": "オッケー！", "zh": "OK！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1026_008tak", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1027_p", "source_sha256": "c0b2565d8870c6fb970d885e964c10facf496d8f95fb06a4a8ac3115ae67dcba", "ja": "紬も、いけるな？", "zh": "䌷也准备好了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1028_051tmg", "source_sha256": "75a7982728ce7b7a5f7bc092814e8e88254cc52d1938b46394742ed3dea755b8", "ja": "もちろんです。\n……わざわざ言わなければ、わかりませんか？", "zh": "当然……非要我说出口，你才会知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1029_p", "source_sha256": "09f244244b29eb1e3339034f0e6ac9ac64d0f025740ca27b3b513d7cb1ea54cf", "ja": "いいや、わかってる！\nそれじゃまた、最後まで見届けさせてもらうよ。", "zh": "不，你不说我也知道！\n那么，再让我好好看到最后吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1030_051tmg", "source_sha256": "df437d7accbc4e95650af01fe90f08883bb9040efbcf8cd8dcdc9b997ce5d65d", "ja": "ええ、そうでなくては困ります。\nあなたは、今日までの日々も、今日からの日々も……。", "zh": "嗯，请你务必看到最后。\n因为无论是过去，还是今后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1031_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ab163a934ded76023d6d2ec3de042738e12cd3e316447e710a381d94a7a9bc84", "ja": "出会ったあの日からずっと。\n私のプロデューサーなのですから！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "从我们相遇的那天开始，\n你就一直都是我的制作人！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1032_p", "source_sha256": "779d656d5a5b2ff3f908db7a86e4ce44b80b70af54c0829fa9afd3fb630400d6", "ja": "（迷いのない足取りで、紬は走っていく。\n輝きに包まれた、ステージへと向かって）", "zh": "（䌷的步伐不带一丝犹豫，\n朝着被光芒笼罩的舞台跑去。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_046_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_046_1033_p", "source_sha256": "27bfee269a18a740e4dd2556189d648b005c3af125aa95971fdd5e9568488354", "ja": "（紬の夢の続き……。\nこれからも、一緒に叶えていかないとな！）", "zh": "（今后，\n也要继续和䌷一起朝着她的梦想迈进！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
